Z||000000||Roy||12-22-1999||07:21 PM||||Its been almost a year now since I bought my first fiero. Which was a 1984 Indy with 20k on it <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ...I love these cars, and my love for these cars hasen't stopped about 5 months after i bought my first fiero, I bought a 1987 gt with a v-6. Then a month later, I found a 1988 gt with factory t-tops at a police seizure auction. So now im the proud owner of three fieros  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> And I love all of them. Im looking for a formula now though to complete my collection.<P>Roy||||reg||14
Z||000001||william_thorniii||12-22-1999||07:33 PM||||Why stop there?  It is common knowledge that the Fiero posses terribly addictive qualities.  Can you imagine some of us still running around in 50 years with our Fieros looking for parts?  I think that it is official... you are a fieroholic.  Welcome to the club.  My name is William and I am a Fieroholic.  The good thing is that we have group therapy going on here all hours of the day, anytime you need a fix.  I left the door open for you guys (dogtired and Monkey).<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
Z||000002||Monkeyman||12-22-1999||11:38 PM||||dog where are you?!  <P>Roy, William's right.  You just might be a Fieroholic.  Just ask yourself these 3 simple questions:<BR>1. Does your love for your Fiero interfere with most normal daily activities (i.e. showering, going to work, eating, sex)?<BR>2. Have you ever lost a job because of your Fiero?<BR>3. Would you chose to make love to your Fiero instead of your wife/significant other (OK, dumb question.  Who wouldn't pick the Fiero?)?<BR>4. Has your Fiero ever gotten you in trouble with the police?  (By this I mean the local law enforcement agents, **NOT** the defunct musical group.)<BR>7. Has your Fiero caused violent mood swings?  (Ask about my dealings with a certain German car loving member.  BTW, VR6-you are forgiven.)<BR>11. Has any doctor ever suggested the use of prescription, mind-altering drugs?  <P>If you can answer yes to all 17 of these questions, you too may be a Fieroholic.  Just stand up and say, "My name is Roy and I'm a Fieroholic."<p>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 12-22-1999).]||||reg||1
